" y="21">5</text></g></g></g></svg><div class="ph-coin-key"><button type="button" class="ph-key-chip" aria-label="Chai with Daddu: what it does"><span class="ph-key-glyph">☕</span> Chai with <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-key-chip" aria-label="Kitty party invite: what it does"><span class="ph-key-glyph">✉</span> Kitty party invite</button><button type="button" class="ph-key-chip" aria-label="Favour returned: what it does"><span class="ph-key-glyph">↺</span> Favour returned</button></div></section><aside class="side ph-side"><div class="ph-vote" aria-live="polite"><h2 class="ph-vote-move"><span class="ph-face" style="--seat: #8cc152;"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #dff1f0, #b9dcda);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#ece9c322</svg></span></span><span class="ph-vote-rooms" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ph-vote-icon">🚙</span><span class="ph-vote-arrow">➜</span><span class="ph-vote-icon">🪔</span></span><span class="sr-only">Gauri wants to move up: 🚙 Parking sub-committee to 🪔 Festival committee</span><span class="ph-clock" role="img" aria-label="12 seconds left"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">#fbc04c09</svg><span class="ph-clock-secs" aria-hidden="true">12</span></span></h2><p class="ph-pips" role="img" aria-label="1 of 2 yes"><span class="on"></span><span class=""></span></p><ul class="ph-voters"><li class="ph-voter wait" style="--seat: #e4572e;" aria-label="Asha, 1 in the room: thinking"><span class="ph-face"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="ph-said" aria-hidden="true">⏳</span></span></li><li class="ph-voter own" style="--seat: #8cc152;" aria-