ur "><button type="button" class="ph-fav-name" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Your favour: Car-pool uncle, 2 of 2 uses left, Bilal asks for it"><span class="ph-fav-glyph" aria-hidden="true">🚗</span><span aria-hidden="true"><b>Car-pool uncle</b><small><span class="ph-uses " role="img" aria-label="2 of 2 uses left">●●</span> 🙏 <span class="ph-inline-face" role="img" aria-label="Bilal"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></span></small></span></button><button type="button" class="btn primary" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Offer your Car-pool uncle to Bilal">🤝 Offer 🚗 → <span class="ph-inline-face" role="img" aria-label="Bilal"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div></section><div class="action-bar ph-bar your-turn"><div class="ph-moves ph-request" role="group" aria-label="A request for your favour"><div class="ph-pick-head"><b class="ph-turn">🙏 Asked</b><span class="ph-pick-what">Bilal asks for your 🚗 Car-pool uncle</span><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div><div class="ph-move-grid"><button type="button" class="btn primary ph-move"><b>✓ Yes, offer it</b><small>+1 izzat if used</small></button><button type="button" class="btn ph-move"><b>✗ No</b><small>keep it</small></button></div></div></div><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-request">Bilal asked you for your 🚗 Car-pool uncle.</li><li class="log-bonus">Bilal picked up ☕ Chai with <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span>: may also move <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span> this turn.</li><li class="log-climb">Bilal moved up from the 🚙 Parking sub-committee to the 🏏 Sports in-charge and took a token.</li><li class="log-done">Chitra ended the turn.</li><li class="log-enter">Chitra joined the 📋 Notice board in-charge.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

