ecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><button class="ph-tray-who" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark">★</span></span><span class="ph-counts"><span role="img" aria-label="5 still to place">✋ 5</span><span role="img" aria-label="0 at the top">▲ 0</span></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-score" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Your izzat: 3"><span aria-hidden="true">🪙</span> <b>3</b></button></div><div class="ph-tokens ph-tray-tokens"><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><button type="button" class="btn small ph-give">🎁 Give</button><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div><div class="ph-my-favour "><button type="button" class="ph-fav-name" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Your favour: Car-pool uncle, 2 of 2 uses left, each use earns you 1 izzat"><span class="ph-fav-glyph" aria-hidden="true">🚗</span><span aria-hidden="true"><b>Car-pool uncle</b><small><span class="ph-uses " role="img" aria-label="2 of 2 uses left">●●</span> +1 🪙</small></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div></section><div class="action-bar ph-bar your-turn"><div class="ph-moves ph-pick"><div class="ph-pick-head"><b class="ph-turn">Your move</b><span class="ph-hint">Tap a glowing room or <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span></span><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button><button type="button" class="btn small ghost ph-chipbtn" aria-expanded="false">All moves</button></div><div class="ph-on-offer" aria-label="Favours for your move"><span class="ph-offer">♞ Daddu’s chess partner <span class="ph-inline-face" role="img" aria-label="Dev"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span></span><button type="button" class="ph-offer-x" aria-label="Turn down Dev’s Daddu’s chess partner">✕</button></span></div></div></div><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-climb">Bilal moved up from the 🎫 Gate pass desk to the 🌳 Garden committee.</li><li class="log-climb">Chitra moved up from the 🛗 Lift in-charge to the 🪔 Festival committee.</li><li class="log-enter">Dev joined the 💬 Residents’ WhatsApp group.</li><li class="log-enter">You joined the 📋 Notice board in-charge.</li><li class="log-enter">Bilal joined the 🎫 Gate pass desk.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

exports[`pahunch pages > lobby-admin 1`] = `"<main class="center-card lobby"><h1 class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></h1><p class="muted">Society Committee · room <span class="room-code"><b class="code">RAJCPX</b><button type="button" class="copy-code " title="Copy room code" aria-label="Copy room code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5 15V6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 7.5 4H15"></path></svg></button></span></p><p>Paste this link in Discord. Everyone who opens it lands in this room.</p><div class="share"><input readonly="" aria-label="Room link" value="http://localhost:3000/#RAJCPX"><button class="btn">Copy link</button><button class="btn share-btn" title="Show the link as a QR code" aria-label="Show the room link as a QR code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon">#b80ee5a5</svg></button></div><fieldset><legend>Theme</legend><h3 class="theme-game">Auction Adda</h3><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Box Office</b><small>Buy films, back the right star, sell them when the season ends.</small></span></label><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Leather &amp; Willow</b><small>Bid for cricketers, back the right franchise, cash in when the tournament ends.</small></span></label><h3 class="theme-game">Pahunch</h3><label class="theme-pick on"><input type="radio" checked="" name="theme"><span><b>Society Committee</b><small>Climb the housing society’s committees to the Chairman’s cabin. Votes have a price.</small></span></label></fieldset><h2>Players <small>(3–5)</small></h2><ol class="lobby-seats"><li class=" me"><span class="avatar-wrap"><button type="button" class="avatar-btn look-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Change your picture" title="Change your picture"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="look-edit" aria-hidden="true">✎</span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></span><span class="grow"><b>Asha</b><span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin">★</span><em> (you)</em></span></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Bilal</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Chitra</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Dev</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class="empty"><span class="avatar empty" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="grow">Empty seat</span><button class="btn small">Add a bot</button></li></ol><section class="watchers"><h3>Watching <small class="muted">(1)</small></h3><ul><li class=""><span class="grow">Esha</span><button type="button" class="btn small ">Remove</button></li></ul></section><p class="admin-note"><span class="admin-mark">★</span> <b>You are the room admin.</b> The admin starts the game and can fill empty seats with bots. The admin can skip an away player's move (a random move is made for them) and set a clock for votes. Hand the role over any time from the Room menu.</p><details class="advanced"><summary>Advanced <small class="muted">room settings, vote clock</small></summary><p class="muted small">Your browser keeps what you pick here for the next room you create.</p><div class="room-settings"><h3>Room settings</h3><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Lock room</b></span><small class="muted">Nobody new takes a seat. People with the link can still watch.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Anyone may freeze</b></span><small class="muted">Every player can freeze the game, which stops the clock, the bots and all moves. Whoever froze it, or the admin, lets it run again.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Players may rename</b></span><small class="muted">Everyone with a seat can change their name, in the lobby and during the game.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>New seats each round</b></span><small class="muted">Seats are drawn at random when a game starts. With this on, they are drawn again at the start of every round.</small></span></label><div class="reaction-set"><span><b>Reactions</b></span><small class="muted">Players float these over their seat. Pick up to 8; none turns reactions off.</small><div class="reaction-choices" role="group" aria-label="Reactions on offer"><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">👏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😂</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😮</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🔥</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😬</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🙏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🎉</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😭</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤔</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💸</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤑</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🙈</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">❤️</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👍</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤝</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😤</button><button type="button" class="btn small">Turn off</button></div></div></div><div class="room-settings"><h3>House rules</h3><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>A failed vote ends the turn</b></span><small class="muted">Off: after a vote fails you choose another move, or ask again. On: the turn passes at once.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Strict: one vote per room, one offer per favour, each turn</b></span><small class="muted">For strict games. On: a room that voted you down will not vote again that turn, and a favour offer that is taken back or turned down is not made again that turn. Off: ask and offer again as often as you like.</small></span></label><label class="toggle on"><input role="switch" type="checkbox" checked=""><span><span><b>Favours</b></span><small class="muted">On: every player gets a different favour with two uses, to offer the mover on their turn; its owner earns points each time it is used. Off: a simpler first game, with no favours.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Everyone sees favour uses left</b></span><small class="muted">Off: each player sees only their own favour’s uses left, so an owner can bluff about theirs; all show at the end. On: everyone sees them.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Avatars on the board</b></span><small class="muted">Display only. On: each player’s pieces show their avatar in a ring of their colour. Off: a disc of their colour with their initial, easier to read on a small phone.</small></span></label></div><div class="bid-timer"><label class="toggle on"><input role="switch" type="checkbox" checked=""><span><span><b>⏱ Vote clock</b></span><small class="muted">Voters have 30 s to answer. When it runs out, whoever has not answered says no.</small></span></label><label>For each vote <select aria-label="Seconds for each vote"><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="45">45 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="90">90 s</option><option value="120">2 min</option><option value="180">3 min</option><option value="300">5 min</option></select></label><label>After an answer, at least <select aria-label="Time after an answer"><option value="3">3 s</option><option value="5">5 s</option><option value="10">10 s</option><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option></select></label></div></details><div class="row"><button class="btn primary big grow">Start with 4 players · 0 of 3 ready</button><button class="btn">Leave</button></div><p class="muted small">You start when everyone is ready (or before, if you must). Seats are drawn at random when the game begins, and nobody new sits down after that.</p><div class="row room-danger"><button type="button" class="btn small ">Close room</button></div><section class="rules"><h2>How to play</h2><p>Everyone in the society wants the Chairman’s cabin. Committees only let a resident move up when most of their members agree, so votes are traded for izzat, promises are made on the call, and the aunties can always be persuaded with a box of kaju katli. Daddu, the senior citizen, sits on one staircase: anyone may walk past him without a vote, but he sits on the izzat there, so nobody takes it.</p><h3>Your turn: one move</h3><p>Tap something glowing on the board, then pick the move in the bar. Anything you tap explains itself.</p><ul><li><b>Add</b> a resident from your hand to a bottom room with a free seat.</li><li><b>Move up</b> one of your residents along a staircase to the room above, if it has a free seat.</li><li><b>Nudge</b> an aunty up a staircase: no vote, and you take 1 izzat.</li><li><b>Send Daddu</b> to another staircase that has izzat on it.</li></ul><h3>Votes</h3><ul><li>Leaving a room takes yes votes from more than half its seats: 2 of 3, 3 of 5, 4 of 7. Leaving a post of one is free.</li><li>Your own residents in the room say yes. Every other player answers for theirs: yes with some of them, or no.</li><li>Each yes the climb needed earns the player who gave it 1 izzat.</li><li>An aunty says yes only for a box of kaju katli: one of your tokens worth 2 or more, and it leaves the game. Two 1s will not do, and there is no change.</li><li>If the vote fails, or you give up, your resident stays. You then pick another move, or ask again. House rules can make it stricter: “A failed vote ends the turn”, or “one vote per room per turn”. Anything paid to an aunty stays paid.</li></ul><h3>Izzat and Daddu</h3><ul><li>Moving up out of a room of 3 or more takes the izzat lying on that staircase; a new coin is drawn for it. Only you see your izzat until the game ends.</li><li>Daddu sits on one staircase. Anyone may climb past him with no vote, but he sits on the izzat there, so nobody takes it.</li><li>Some coins carry a mark. Take one with your own climb and it does something extra, once:<ul><li><b>☕ Chai with Daddu:</b> After your move this turn, you may also send Daddu to another staircase.</li><li><b>✉ Kitty party invite:</b> After your move this turn, you may also nudge an aunty up.</li><li><b>↺ Favour returned:</b> One use of your favour comes back at once (two at most).</li></ul>In your hand it is a plain 2.</li><li>After your move, any extra moves you have glow. Use them in any order, or press <b>End turn</b>.</li><li>Give tokens to anyone, at any time. Deals are made on the call, and nothing makes anyone keep them.</li></ul><h3>Back stairs 🔒</h3><p>Dashed back stairs are locked. They open for the mover only when someone offers them 🔑 Back-gate key; the climb then needs no vote. No izzat lies on them, and Daddu never goes there.</p><h3>Favours</h3><ul><li>Each player gets one favour, different for everyone, with two uses. Everyone sees whose favour is whose.</li><li>A favour helps only someone else’s move, never your own. On another player’s turn, offer yours to them. Each use earns you izzat and costs a use. An offer that is not used costs nothing.</li><li>On your turn, tap another player’s favour to ask for it. They answer yes (it is on offer to you) or no. Your move does not wait for the answer.</li><li>What the mover gives you for it is agreed on the call, and paid with gifts.</li><li><b>♞ Daddu’s chess partner:</b> The mover also sends Daddu to another staircase, before or after their move.</li><li><b>♥ Daddu’s favourite:</b> Walking past Daddu, the mover still takes the izzat he sits on.</li><li><b>⇄ Kitty party host:</b> Moving up, the mover takes any other izzat lying on the board instead of the one on their staircase.</li><li><b>⏩ Fast-track:</b> A resident the mover puts into a one-seat post moves up again at once.</li><li><b>+1 Builder’s relative:</b> The mover fits one extra into a full committee (never the Chairman’s cabin).</li><li><b>🔑 Back-gate key:</b> The mover may use a back staircase, with no vote.</li><li><b>🚗 Car-pool uncle:</b> Moving up, the mover brings one more resident or aunty from the same room along. It takes no izzat, and its owner has no say.</li></ul><h3>The end</h3><p>The game ends the moment the Chairman’s cabin is full. Aunties can take seats there too. Only players with a resident in the Chairman’s cabin can win: the most izzat wins, and a tie goes to whoever got there first. If the admin ends the game early, nobody wins.</p></section></main>"`;

exports[`pahunch pages > over 1`] = `"<div class="table ph-table  "><header class="topbar"><span class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></span><span class="round"><b>Final result</b> · 👑 Chairman’s cabin 4/5</span><span class="grow"></span><button class="icon-btn" title="What happened" aria-label="Log">☰ <span class="lbl">Log</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Sound on" aria-label="Turn sound off">🔊</button><button class="icon-btn" aria-expanded="false" title="Room and rules" aria-label="Room and rules">? <span class="lbl">Room</span></button></header><div class="notices"></div><section class="seats ph-players" aria-label="Players"><div class="seat ph-seat-chip    " data-seat="0" style="--seat: #e4572e; --seat-ink: #1a0d08;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button><svg class="ph-swatch" viewBox="-1.6 -1.6 3.2 3.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-0.95 0a0.95 0.95 0 1 0 1.9 0a0.95 0.95 0 1 0 -1.9 0Z"></path></svg></div><button class="seat-body ph-seat-more" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="seat-name">Chitra</span><span class="seat-line ph-counts"><span role="img" aria-label="0 still to place">✋ 0</span><span role="img" aria-label="0 at the top">▲ 0</span><b class="ph-points" role="img" aria-label="7 izzat">🪙 7</b></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-fav-btn  " aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Chitra’s favour: Builder’s relative, 2 of 2 uses left"><span class="ph-fav-glyph" aria-hidden="true">+1</span><span class="ph-fav-side" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ph-uses " role="img" aria-label="2 of 2 uses left">●●</span></span></button></div><div class="seat ph-seat-chip    winner" data-seat="1" style="--seat: #4ea5d9; --seat-ink: #06141c;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" ar