3px;"></i><i class="c0" style="left: 56.80355024524033%; animation-delay: 1478.289000224322ms; animation-duration: 2374.140948243439ms; --spin: -309deg; --drift: 25px;"></i><i class="c1" style="left: 14.14734951686114%; animation-delay: 1539.5132094388828ms; animation-duration: 2586.990858381614ms; --spin: 102deg; --drift: -17px;"></i><i class="c2" style="left: 54.55937671940774%; animation-delay: 1732.9953133128583ms; animation-duration: 2300.9973482694477ms; --spin: -281deg; --drift: -26px;"></i><i class="c3" style="left: 68.09252433013171%; animation-delay: 940.8935726154596ms; animation-duration: 2939.4757573492825ms; --spin: -87deg; --drift: 22px;"></i><i class="c4" style="left: 26.30140222609043%; animation-delay: 975.192808220163ms; animation-duration: 3597.8816071990877ms; --spin: 344deg; --drift: -39px;"></i><i class="c0" style="left: 86.08166712801903%; animation-delay: 1001.0830763261765ms; animation-duration: 2748.0466410517693ms; --spin: 77deg; --drift: 2px;"></i><i class="c1" style="left: 38.45421082805842%; animation-delay: 1541.3176127476618ms; animation-duration: 2388.3032562676817ms; --spin: -155deg; --drift: 37px;"></i></div><p class="muted ph-eligible">Only players with a resident in the 👑 Chairman’s cabin could win.</p><h2>Bilal wins!</h2><ol class="podium"><li class="place place-2" style="--d: 350ms;"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="who">Dev</span><b class="money">0 izzat</b><span class="block" aria-label="Place 2">2</span></li><li class="place place-1" style="--d: 650ms;"><span class="crown" title="Winner"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M4 8l4 4 4-6.5 4 6.5 4-4-1.6 9.5H5.6z"></path><path d="M6 20.5h12"></path></svg></span><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="who">Bilal</span><b class="money">0 izzat</b><span class="block" aria-label="Place 1">1</span></li><li class="place place-3" style="--d: 0ms;"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="who">Asha<em> (you)</em></span><b class="money">0 izzat</b><span class="block" aria-label="Place 3">3</span></li></ol><ol class="also-ran" start="4"><li value="4"><span>Chitra</span><b>7 izzat</b></li></ol><div class="row gameover-next"><button type="button" class="btn primary big">Play again</button><button type="button" class="btn big" title="Back to the lobby with the same players: change the theme, cast, clock or players">Change setup</button></div></div></section><aside class="side ph-side"><section class="ph-tray " aria-label="You" style="--seat: #8cc152; --seat-ink: #0f1a06;"><div class="ph-tray-head"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><svg class="ph-swatch" viewBox="-1.6 -1.6 3.2 3.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0.81 0.81L-0.81 0.81L-0.81 -0.81L0.81 -0.81Z"></path></svg><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><button class="ph-tray-who" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark">★</span></span><span class="ph-counts"><span role="img" aria-label="2 still to place">✋ 2</span><span role="img" aria-label="1 at the top">▲ 1</span></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-score" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Your izzat: 18"><span aria-hidden="true">🪙</span> <b>18</b></button></div><div class="ph-tokens ph-tray-tokens"><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v2">2</span><span class="ph-chip v3">3</span><span class="ph-chip v5">5</span></div></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-end">Bilal won.</li><li class="log-reward">Chitra earned 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-nudge">Chitra nudged an <span class="ph-inline-who"><span class="ph-inline-face neutral" aria-hidden="true"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#556897a1</svg></span></span>aunty</span> up from the 🛡️ Security committee to the 👑 Chairman’s cabin and took 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-enter">Dev joined the 🚙 Parking sub-committee.</li><li class="log-climb">You moved up from the 🚙 Parking sub-committee to the 🏏 Sports in-charge with the votes and took 3 izzat.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

