n><span class="ph-vote-arrow">➜</span><span class="ph-vote-icon">🌳</span></span><span class="sr-only">Dev wants to move up: 🚙 Parking sub-committee to 🌳 Garden committee</span><span class="ph-clock" role="img" aria-label="12 seconds left"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">#fbc04c09</svg><span class="ph-clock-secs" aria-hidden="true">12</span></span></h2><p class="ph-pips" role="img" aria-label="1 of 2 yes"><span class="on"></span><span class=""></span></p><ul class="ph-voters"><li class="ph-voter wait" style="--seat: #4ea5d9;" aria-label="Bilal, 1 in the room: thinking"><span class="ph-face"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="ph-said" aria-hidden="true">⏳</span></span></li><li class="ph-voter own" style="--seat: #c18ae0;" aria-label="Dev, 1 in the room: yes (own)"><span class="ph-face"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="ph-said" aria-hidden="true">⬆</span></span></li><li class="ph-voter neutral wait" aria-label="1 aunty: 0 paid"><span class="ph-face"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#556897a1</svg></span><span class="ph-said ph-paid" aria-hidden="true">0</span></span></li></ul></div><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-ask">Dev asked to move up from the 🚙 Parking sub-committee to the 🌳 Garden committee: 2 votes needed.</li><li class="log-reward">Asha earned 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-nudge">Asha nudged an <span class="ph-inline-who"><span class="ph-inline-face neutral" aria-hidden="true"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#556897a1</svg></span></span>aunty</span> up from the 🌳 Garden committee to the 💰 Treasurer’s desk and took 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-request">Asha asked Bilal for their ⇄ Kitty party host.</li><li class="log-enter">Bilal joined the 🚙 Parking sub-committee.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

