 " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div><div class="ph-my-favour "><button type="button" class="ph-fav-name" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Your favour: Car-pool uncle, 2 of 2 uses left, each use earns you 1 izzat"><span class="ph-fav-glyph" aria-hidden="true">🚗</span><span aria-hidden="true"><b>Car-pool uncle</b><small><span class="ph-uses " role="img" aria-label="2 of 2 uses left">●●</span> +1 🪙</small></span></button><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div></section><div class="action-bar ph-bar "><div class="ph-moves" role="group" aria-label="Your climb"><div class="ph-pick-head"><b class="ph-turn">↑ Your climb</b><span class="ph-pick-what">1 of 2 yes · ask on the call</span><button type="button" class="ph-tip-btn " aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tip">💡</button></div><div class="ph-move-grid"><button class="btn ph-move"><b>✗ Give up</b><small>then pick another move</small></button></div></div></div><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-ask">You asked to move up from the 🪔 Festival committee to the 🛡️ Security committee: 2 votes needed.</li><li class="log-enter">Bilal joined the 💬 Residents’ WhatsApp group.</li><li class="log-reward">Dev earned 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-favour">Chitra used Dev’s ♞ <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span>’s chess partner.</li><li class="log-block">Chitra sent <span class="ph-inline-face blocker" role="img" aria-label="Daddu"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e7e7ea, #cbccd3);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#3f139598</svg></span></span> to the staircase from the 🌳 Garden committee to the 📊 Managing committee.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

