-climb">Chitra moved up from the 📋 Notice board in-charge to the 🛗 Lift in-charge.</li><li class="log-climb">Dev moved up from the 🚙 Parking sub-committee to the 🌳 Garden committee with the votes and took a token.</li><li class="log-reward">Bilal earned 1 izzat.</li><li class="log-vote">Bilal voted yes.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

