s="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Pappu Pandey films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: +30" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Pappu Pandey, past seasons: Sankranti: +30"><i class="t0">30</i></button></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural<em class="held"> · 2 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Tantrik Tiwari films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: –" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari, past seasons: Sankranti: –"><i class="none">–</i></button></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic<em class="held"> · 4 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Rajkumari Ratnavali films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: +20" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali, past seasons: Sankranti: +20"><i class="t1">20</i></button></li></ol></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-round">Summer begins. Everyone gets 4 new films. <b>Dev</b> goes first.</li><li class="log-shelved"><b class="you">You</b> play <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Padosi Ki Bhains</span></span>. Overexposed! The 5th film is stuck with the Censor Board forever.</li><li class="log-sold"><b class="you">You</b> buy <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Suitcase Badal Gaya</span></span><span> + <span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Group Photo Mein Gadbad</span></span> from <b>Chitra</b> for ₹18 cr</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Dev</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Pyaar Via Bluetooth</span></span><span> + <span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Long Distance Ladoo</span></span> from <b>Bilal</b> for ₹7 cr</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

exports[`room pages > fixed-buying 1`] = `"<div class="table acting "><header class="topbar"><span class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></span><button type="button" class="round round-btn" title="All seasons: the deal, the scoring and where the game is" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg class="round-ring" viewBox="0 0 22 22" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true">#2cbf88b0</svg><b>Sankranti</b> · season 1 of 4</button><span class="grow"></span><button class="icon-btn" title="Freeze the game: the clock, the bots and all moves wait" aria-label="Freeze the game"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M12 3v18M4.2 7.5l15.6 9M4.2 16.5l15.6-9"></path><path d="M9.5 4.5L12 7l2.5-2.5M9.5 19.5L12 17l2.5 2.5"></path></svg> <span class="lbl">Freeze</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Auction log" aria-label="Auction log">☰ <span class="lbl">Log</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Sound on" aria-label="Turn sound off">🔊</button><button class="icon-btn" aria-expanded="false" title="Room and rules" aria-label="Room and rules">? <span class="lbl">Room</span></button></header><div class="notices"></div><section class="seats arc" aria-label="Players"><div class="seat     " data-seat="2" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Dev"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Dev</div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">Sells next</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="2" aria-label="Dev has bought no films this season" title="Dev has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat     " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal has bought no films this season" title="Bilal has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat     " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra has bought no films this season" title="Chitra has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div></section><section class="stage owing stage-fixed"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Senapati On Leave — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Fixed Price"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#52709cb3</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Senapati On Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Seven wars. Nine songs.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays."><span class="type-icon">=</span> Fixed Price<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Fixed Price: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">You set the price…</div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: You<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Dev</b></span><span class="hint"> · The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-fixed" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop now me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You 🔨</span><span class="stop-state">pricing</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar your-turn"><form class="bidbox"><div class="bid-amount"><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One less">−</button><label class="amount"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true">₹</span><input inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-label="Set price amount" type="text" value="10"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"> cr</span><span class="of">of ₹100 cr</span></label><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One more">+</button></div><div class="quick"><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+5</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+10</button></div><div class="act-row"><button class="btn primary big">Set price ₹10 cr <kbd>Enter</kbd></button></div><p class="hint">If nobody buys at your price, you pay it to the bank and keep the lot.</p></form></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra</option><option value="1">You (seller)</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="0"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me owing   " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style