 Bid"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e6a9e1e8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>✉</b><span>Sealed Bid</span></div><div class="poster-code">KK</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Kajal Khurana</div><div class="poster-title">Chiffon Mein Chills</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">She missed the train. He bought the station.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#2f4c4f0f</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="group-label">● PP <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Padosi Ki Bhains, Pappu Pandey, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Padosi Ki Bhains — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#523f4128</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Padosi Ki Bhains</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Fufaji walked out of the trailer.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="group-label">☠ TT <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Saaya Society, Tantrik Tiwari, Fixed Price (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Saaya Society — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Fixed Price"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#939f1937</svg><div cla