class="poster-tag">Ten thousand extras. One close-up.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button></div></div></div></section><aside class="side"><section class="star-race" aria-label="Box Office Chart"><h2><span class="chart-title">Box Office Chart<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="How to read the Box Office Chart"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></span><small>5th film of a star ends the season</small></h2><ol class="star-rows"><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="Flop: Bijli Bhullar is outside the top three this season, so films bought now would pay nothing">flop</span></li><li class="star-row    " style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="3 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="What one Kajal Khurana film would pay if the season ended now: ₹10 cr as Semi-Hit, plus its scores from earlier seasons">₹10 cr<small>Semi-Hit</small></span></li><li class="star-row hot   " style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Pappu Pandey</