 Bluetooth</span></span><span> + <span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Long Distance Ladoo</span></span> from <b>Bilal</b> for ₹7 cr</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Bilal</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #9cbd34;">Mirror Mat Dekhna</span></span> from <b>Dev</b> for ₹27 cr</li><li class="log-free"><b class="you">You</b> take <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #9cbd34;">Haveli No. 13</span></span> for free</li><li class="log-free"><b>Chitra</b> takes <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Rishta Via Resume</span></span> for free</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

exports[`room pages > lobby-admin 1`] = `"<main class="center-card lobby"><h1 class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></h1><p class="muted">Box Office · room <span class="room-code"><b class="code">HDMHDN</b><button type="button" class="copy-code " title="Copy room code" aria-label="Copy room code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5 15V6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 7.5 4H15"></path></svg></button></span></p><p>Paste this link in Discord. Everyone who opens it lands in this room.</p><div class="share"><input readonly="" aria-label="Room link" value="http://localhost:3000/#HDMHDN"><button class="btn">Copy link</button><button class="btn share-btn" title="Show the link as a QR code" aria-label="Show the room link as a QR code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon">#b80ee5a5</svg></button></div><fieldset><legend>Theme</legend><h3 class="theme-game">Auction Adda</h3><label class="theme-pick on"><input type="radio" checked="" name="theme"><span><b>Box Office</b><small>Buy films, back the right star, sell them when the season ends.</small></span></label><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Leather &amp; Willow</b><small>Bid for cricketers, back the right franchise, cash in when the tournament ends.</small></span></label><h3 class="theme-game">Pahunch</h3><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Society Committee</b><small>Climb the housing society’s committees to the Chairman’s cabin. Votes have a price.</small></span></label></fieldset><h2>Players <small>(3–5)</small></h2><ol class="lobby-seats"><li class=" me"><span class="avatar-wrap"><button type="button" class="avatar-btn look-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Change your picture" title="Change your picture"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="look-edit" aria-hidden="true">✎</span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></span><span class="grow"><b>Asha</b><span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin">★</span><em> (you)</em></span></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Bilal</b></span><span class="ready-mark on" title="Ready to play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg> ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Chitra</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Dev</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class="empty"><span class="avatar empty" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="grow">Empty seat</span><button class="btn small">Add a bot</button></li></ol><section class="watchers"><h3>Watching <small class="muted">(1)</small></h3><ul><li class=""><span class="grow">Esha</span><button type="button" class="btn small ">Remove</button></li></ul></section><p class="admin-note"><span class="admin-mark">★</span> <b>You are the room admin.</b> The admin starts the game and can fill empty seats with bots. Playing on voice? The admin can end an auction with the result the table agreed (and undo a wrong call). Hand the role over any time from the Room menu.</p><details class="advanced"><summary>Advanced <small class="muted">room settings, clock, stars and names</small></summary><p class="muted small">Your browser keeps what you pick here for the next room you create.</p><div class="room-settings"><h3>Room settings</h3><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Lock room</b></span><small class="muted">Nobody new takes a seat. People with the link can still watch.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Anyone may freeze</b></span><small class="muted">Every player can freeze the game, which stops the clock, the bots and all moves. Whoever froze it, or the admin, lets it run again.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Players may rename</b></span><small class="muted">Everyone with a seat can change their name, in the lobby and during the game.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>New seats each round</b></span><small class="muted">Seats are drawn at random when a game starts. With this on, they are drawn again at the start of every round.</small></span></label><div class="reaction-set"><span><b>Reactions</b></span><small class="muted">Players float these over their seat. Pick up to 8; none turns reactions off.</small><div class="reaction-choices" role="group" aria-label="Reactions on offer"><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">👏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😂</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😮</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🔥</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😬</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🙏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🎉</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😭</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤔</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💸</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤑</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🙈</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">❤️</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👍</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤝</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😤</button><button type="button" class="btn small">Turn off</button></div></div></div><div class="bid-timer"><h3>Open-auction clock</h3><label>When a lot goes up <select><option value="0">No limit</option><option value="10">10 s</option><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="45">45 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="90">90 s</option><option value="120">2 min</option><option value="180">3 min</option><option value="300">5 min</option><option value="600">10 min</option></select></label><label>After a bid, at least <select><option value="3">3 s</option><option value="5">5 s</option><option value="8">8 s</option><option value="10">10 s</option><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="45">45 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="90">90 s</option><option value="120">2 min</option></select></label><small class="muted">Players still in have 30 s once a lot goes up. A bid with less than 10 s left tops the clock up to 10 s. When it runs out, they are done.</small></div><section class="cast"><h2>This game’s stars</h2><ul class="cast-suits"><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg><span><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg><span><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg><span><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg><span><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg><span><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic</small></span></li></ul><div class="cast-genres" role="group" aria-label="Pick 5 stars"><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Action</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Romance</button><button class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false" style="--suit: #c9852c; --suit-ink: #221303;">☀ Mass hero</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Comedy</button><button class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false" style="--suit: #6a6fcb; --suit-ink: #fff;">☾ Art-house</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Horror</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Period epic</button></div><div class="row"><button class="btn small">New names</button><button class="btn small">Random stars</button></div><p class="muted small">Picked at random from 7. Every star gets new names each game.</p></section></details><div class="row"><button class="btn primary big grow">Start with 4 players · 1 of 3 ready</button><button class="btn">Leave</button></div><p class="muted small">You start when everyone is ready (or before, if you must). Seats are drawn at random when the game begins, and nobody new sits down after that.</p><div class="row room-danger"><button type="button" class="btn small ">Close room</button></div><details class="rules"><summary>How to play</summary><ul><li>On your turn, put one film from your hand up for auction. The winner pays <b>you</b>; if you win your own auction, you pay the bank.</li><li>The season ends the moment card number 5 of one star is played. That film is not sold.</li><li>The three stars with the most films played that season score ₹30 cr / ₹20 cr / ₹10 cr per film (All-Time Blockbuster / Superhit / Semi-Hit). Ties go to the star higher on the chart.</li><li>The bank then buys every film you bought this season at its star’s value: this season’s score <b>plus that star’s scores from earlier seasons</b>. A star outside the top three pays nothing, whatever it earned before.</li><li>4 seasons. Most seasons start with new films dealt to everyone (see “The deck and the deal”); unplayed films stay in your hand. Most money at the end wins.</li></ul><dl><div><dt><b class="type-icon">⇈</b> Open Auction</dt><dd>Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">↻</b> Once Around</dt><dd>One bid each, going round the table. The seller bids last.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">✉</b> Sealed Bid</dt><dd>Everyone bids in secret, once. Highest wins; a tie goes to the seller, then clockwise.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">=</b> Fixed Price</dt><dd>The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">×2</b> Double Feature</dt><dd>Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</dd></div></dl></details><details class="rules"><summary>The deck and the deal</summary><div class="deck-info"><p class="hint">70 films in the game. Each star has this many of each auction type:</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Star</th><th title="Open Auction"><span class="type-icon">⇈</span></th><th title="Once Around"><span class="type-icon">↻</span></th><th title="Sealed Bid"><span class="type-icon">✉</span></th><th title="Fixed Price"><span class="type-icon">=</span></th><th title="Double Feature"><span class="type-icon">×2</span></th><th>All</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Bijli Bhullar</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td><b>12</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Kajal Khurana</span></th><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>13</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Pappu Pandey</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>14</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Tantrik Tiwari</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>15</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Rajkumari Ratnavali</span></th><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>16</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Films dealt to each player at the start of each season. Unplayed films carry over; the rest are never dealt.</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Players</th><th>Sankranti</th><th>Summer</th><th>Eid</th><th>Diwali</th><th>Never dealt</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><th class="left">3</th><td>10</td><td>+6</td><td>+6</td><td>—</td><td>4</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">4</th><td>9</td><td>+4</td><td>+4</td><td>—</td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">5</th><td>8</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td><td>—</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Icons: ⇈ Open Auction · ↻ Once Around · ✉ Sealed Bid · = Fixed Price · ×2 Double Feature.</p></div></details></main>"`;

exports[`room pages > lobby-admin on a phone 1`] = `"<main class="center-card lobby"><h1 class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></h1><p class="muted">Box Office · room <span class="room-code"><b class="code">HDMHDN</b><button type="button" class="copy-code " title="Copy room code" aria-label="Copy room code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5 15V6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 7.5 4H15"></path></svg></button></span></p><p>Paste this link in Discord. Everyone who opens it lands in this room.</p><div class="share"><input readonly="" aria-label="Room link" value="http://localhost:3000/#HDMHDN"><button class="btn">Copy link</button><button class="btn share-btn" title="Show the link as a QR code" aria-label="Show the room link as a QR code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon">#b80ee5a5</svg></button></div><fieldset><legend>Theme</legend><h3 class="theme-game">Auction Adda</h3><label class="theme-pick on"><input type="radio" checked="" name="theme"><span><b>Box Office</b><small>Buy films, back the right star, sell them when the season ends.</small></span></label><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Leather &amp; Willow</b><small>Bid for cricketers, back the right franchise, cash in when the tournament ends.</small></span></label><h3 class="theme-game">Pahunch</h3><label class="theme-pick "><input type="radio" name="theme"><span><b>Society Committee</b><small>Climb the housing society’s committees to the Chairman’s cabin. Votes have a price.</small></span></label></fieldset><h2>Players <small>(3–5)</small></h2><ol class="lobby-seats"><li class=" me"><span class="avatar-wrap"><button type="button" class="avatar-btn look-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Change your picture" title="Change your picture"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="look-edit" aria-hidden="true">✎</span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></span><span class="grow"><b>Asha</b><span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin">★</span><em> (you)</em></span></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Bilal</b></span><span class="ready-mark on" title="Ready to play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg> ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Chitra</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Dev</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span><button class="btn small">Kick</button></li><li class="empty"><span class="avatar empty" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="grow">Empty seat</span><button class="btn small">Add a bot</button></li></ol><section class="watchers"><h3>Watching <small class="muted">(1)</small></h3><ul><li class=""><span class="grow">Esha</span><button type="button" class="btn small ">Remove</button></li></ul></section><p class="admin-note"><span class="admin-mark">★</span> <b>You are the room admin.</b> The admin starts the game and can fill empty seats with bots. Playing on voice? The admin can end an auction with the result the table agreed (and undo a wrong call). Hand the role over any time from the Room menu.</p><details class="advanced"><summary>Advanced <small class="muted">room settings, clock, stars and names</small></summary><p class="muted small">Your browser keeps what you pick here for the next room you create.</p><div class="room-settings"><h3>Room settings</h3><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Lock room</b></span><small class="muted">Nobody new takes a seat. People with the link can still watch.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Anyone may freeze</b></span><small class="muted">Every player can freeze the game, which stops the clock, the bots and all moves. Whoever froze it, or the admin, lets it run again.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Players may rename</b></span><small class="muted">Everyone with a seat can change their name, in the lobby and during the game.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>New seats each round</b></span><small class="muted">Seats are drawn at random when a game starts. With this on, they are drawn again at the start of every round.</small></span></label><div class="reaction-set"><span><b>Reactions</b></span><small class="muted">Players float these over their seat. Pick up to 8; none turns reactions off.</small><div class="reaction-choices" role="group" aria-label="Reactions on offer"><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">👏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😂</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😮</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🔥</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">😬</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true">🙏</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🎉</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😭</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤔</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💸</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤑</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🙈</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">💀</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">❤️</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👍</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">👎</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">🤝</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false">😤</button><button type="button" class="btn small">Turn off</button></div></div></div><div class="bid-timer"><h3>Open-auction clock</h3><label>When a lot goes up <select><option value="0">No limit</option><option value="10">10 s</option><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="45">45 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="90">90 s</option><option value="120">2 min</option><option value="180">3 min</option><option value="300">5 min</option><option value="600">10 min</option></select></label><label>After a bid, at least <select><option value="3">3 s</option><option value="5">5 s</option><option value="8">8 s</option><option value="10">10 s</option><option value="15">15 s</option><option value="20">20 s</option><option value="30">30 s</option><option value="45">45 s</option><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="90">90 s</option><option value="120">2 min</option></select></label><small class="muted">Players still in have 30 s once a lot goes up. A bid with less than 10 s left tops the clock up to 10 s. When it runs out, they are done.</small></div><section class="cast"><h2>This game’s stars</h2><ul class="cast-suits"><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg><span><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg><span><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg><span><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg><span><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg><span><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic</small></span></li></ul><div class="cast-genres" role="group" aria-label="Pick 5 stars"><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Action</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Romance</button><button class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false" style="--suit: #c9852c; --suit-ink: #221303;">☀ Mass hero</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Comedy</button><button class="chip-btn " aria-pressed="false" style="--suit: #6a6fcb; --suit-ink: #fff;">☾ Art-house</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Horror</button><button class="chip-btn on" aria-pressed="true" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Period epic</button></div><div class="row"><button class="btn small">New names</button><button class="btn small">Random stars</button></div><p class="muted small">Picked at random from 7. Every star gets new names each game.</p></section></details><div class="row"><button class="btn primary big grow">Start with 4 players · 1 of 3 ready</button><button class="btn">Leave</button></div><p class="muted small">You start when everyone is ready (or before, if you must). Seats are drawn at random when the game begins, and nobody new sits down after that.</p><div class="row room-danger"><button type="button" class="btn small ">Close room</button></div><details class="rules"><summary>How to play</summary><ul><li>On your turn, put one film from your hand up for auction. The winner pays <b>you</b>; if you win your own auction, you pay the bank.</li><li>The season ends the moment card number 5 of one star is played. That film is not sold.</li><li>The three stars with the most films played that season score ₹30 cr / ₹20 cr / ₹10 cr per film (All-Time Blockbuster / Superhit / Semi-Hit). Ties go to the star higher on the chart.</li><li>The bank then buys every film you bought this season at its star’s value: this season’s score <b>plus that star’s scores from earlier seasons</b>. A star outside the top three pays nothing, whatever it earned before.</li><li>4 seasons. Most seasons start with new films dealt to everyone (see “The deck and the deal”); unplayed films stay in your hand. Most money at the end wins.</li></ul><dl><div><dt><b class="type-icon">⇈</b> Open Auction</dt><dd>Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">↻</b> Once Around</dt><dd>One bid each, going round the table. The seller bids last.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">✉</b> Sealed Bid</dt><dd>Everyone bids in secret, once. Highest wins; a tie goes to the seller, then clockwise.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">=</b> Fixed Price</dt><dd>The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">×2</b> Double Feature</dt><dd>Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</dd></div></dl></details><details class="rules"><summary>The deck and the deal</summary><div class="deck-info"><p class="hint">70 films in the game. Each star has this many of each auction type:</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Star</th><th title="Open Auction"><span class="type-icon">⇈</span></th><th title="Once Around"><span class="type-icon">↻</span></th><th title="Sealed Bid"><span class="type-icon">✉</span></th><th title="Fixed Price"><span class="type-icon">=</span></th><th title="Double Feature"><span class="type-icon">×2</span></th><th>All</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Bijli Bhullar</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td><b>12</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Kajal Khurana</span></th><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>13</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Pappu Pandey</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>14</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Tantrik Tiwari</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>15</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Rajkumari Ratnavali</span></th><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>16</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Films dealt to each player at the start of each season. Unplayed films carry over; the rest are never dealt.</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Players</th><th>Sankranti</th><th>Summer</th><th>Eid</th><th>Diwali</th><th>Never dealt</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><th class="left">3</th><td>10</td><td>+6</td><td>+6</td><td>—</td><td>4</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">4</th><td>9</td><td>+4</td><td>+4</td><td>—</td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">5</th><td>8</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td><td>—</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Icons: ⇈ Open Auction · ↻ Once Around · ✉ Sealed Bid · = Fixed Price · ×2 Double Feature.</p></div></details></main>"`;

exports[`room pages > lobby-player 1`] = `"<main class="center-card lobby"><h1 class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></h1><p class="muted">Box Office · room <span class="room-code"><b class="code">HDMHDN</b><button type="button" class="copy-code " title="Copy room code" aria-label="Copy room code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M5 15V6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 7.5 4H15"></path></svg></button></span></p><p>Paste this link in Discord. Everyone who opens it lands in this room.</p><div class="share"><input readonly="" aria-label="Room link" value="http://localhost:3000/#HDMHDN"><button class="btn">Copy link</button><button class="btn share-btn" title="Show the link as a QR code" aria-label="Show the room link as a QR code"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon">#b80ee5a5</svg></button></div><h2>Players <small>(3–5)</small></h2><ol class="lobby-seats"><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Asha</b><span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin">★</span></span></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Bilal</b></span><span class="ready-mark on" title="Ready to play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg> ready</span></li><li class=" me"><span class="avatar-wrap"><button type="button" class="avatar-btn look-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="Change your picture" title="Change your picture"><span class="avatar on" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="look-edit" aria-hidden="true">✎</span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></span><span class="grow"><b>Chitra</b><em> (you)</em></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span></li><li class=" "><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="grow"><b>Dev</b></span><span class="ready-mark">not ready</span></li><li class="empty"><span class="avatar empty" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="grow">Empty seat</span></li></ol><section class="watchers"><h3>Watching <small class="muted">(1)</small></h3><ul><li class=""><span class="grow">Esha</span></li></ul></section><p class="admin-note"><span class="admin-mark">★</span> <b>Asha is the room admin.</b> The admin starts the game and can fill empty seats with bots. Playing on voice? The admin can end an auction with the result the table agreed (and undo a wrong call). Hand the role over any time from the Room menu.</p><details class="advanced"><summary>Advanced <small class="muted">room settings, clock, stars and names</small></summary><div class="room-settings"><h3>Room settings</h3><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" disabled="" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Lock room</b><em>: off</em></span><small class="muted">Nobody new takes a seat. People with the link can still watch.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" disabled="" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Anyone may freeze</b><em>: off</em></span><small class="muted">Every player can freeze the game, which stops the clock, the bots and all moves. Whoever froze it, or the admin, lets it run again.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" disabled="" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>Players may rename</b><em>: off</em></span><small class="muted">Everyone with a seat can change their name, in the lobby and during the game.</small></span></label><label class="toggle "><input role="switch" disabled="" type="checkbox"><span><span><b>New seats each round</b><em>: off</em></span><small class="muted">Seats are drawn at random when a game starts. With this on, they are drawn again at the start of every round.</small></span></label><div class="reaction-set"><span><b>Reactions</b><em>: 👏 😂 😮 🔥 😬 🙏</em></span><small class="muted">Players float these over their seat.</small></div></div><div class="bid-timer"><h3>Open-auction clock</h3><label>When a lot goes up <b>30 s</b></label><label>After a bid, at least <b>10 s</b></label><small class="muted">Players still in have 30 s once a lot goes up. A bid with less than 10 s left tops the clock up to 10 s. When it runs out, they are done.</small></div><section class="cast"><h2>This game’s stars</h2><ul class="cast-suits"><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg><span><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg><span><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com</small><