veryone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">↻</b> Once Around</dt><dd>One bid each, going round the table. The seller bids last.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">✉</b> Sealed Bid</dt><dd>Everyone bids in secret, once. Highest wins; a tie goes to the seller, then clockwise.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">=</b> Fixed Price</dt><dd>The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">×2</b> Double Feature</dt><dd>Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</dd></div></dl></details><details class="rules"><summary>The deck and the deal</summary><div class="deck-info"><p class="hint">70 films in the game. Each star has this many of each auction type:</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Star</th><th title="Open Auction"><span class="type-icon">⇈</span></th><th title="Once Around"><span class="type-icon">↻</span></th><th title="Sealed Bid"><span class="type-icon">✉</span></th><th title="Fixed Price"><span class="type-icon">=</span></th><th title="Double Feature"><span class="type-icon">×2</span></th><th>All</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Bijli Bhullar</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td><b>12</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Kajal Khurana</span></th><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>13</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Pappu Pandey</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>14</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Tantrik Tiwari</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>15</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Rajkumari Ratnavali</span></th><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>16</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Films dealt to each player at the start of each season. Unplayed films carry over; the rest are never dealt.</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Players</th><th>Sankranti</th><th>Summer</th><th>Eid</th><th>Diwali</th><th>Never dealt</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><th class="left">3</th><td>10</td><td>+6</td><td>+6</td><td>—</td><td>4</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">4</th><td>9</td><td>+4</td><td>+4</td><td>—</td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">5</th><td>8</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td><td>—</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Icons: ⇈ Open Auction · ↻ Once Around · ✉ Sealed Bid · = Fixed Price · ×2 Double Feature.</p></div></details></main>"`;

exports[`room pages > offer-buying 1`] = `"<div class="table  "><header class="topbar"><span class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></span><button type="button" class="round round-btn" title="All seasons: the deal, the scoring and where the game is" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg class="round-ring" viewBox="0 0 22 22" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true">#2cbf88b0</svg><b>Sankranti</b> · season 1 of 4</button><span class="grow"></span><button class="icon-btn" title="Freeze the game: the clock, the bots and all moves wait" aria-label="Freeze the game"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M12 3v18M4.2 7.5l15.6 9M4.2 16.5l15.6-9"></path><path d="M9.5 4.5L12 7l2.5-2.5M9.5 19.5L12 17l2.5 2.5"></path></svg> <span class="lbl">Freeze</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Auction log" aria-label="Auction log">☰ <span class="lbl">Log</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Sound on" aria-label="Turn sound off">🔊</button><button class="icon-btn" aria-expanded="false" title="Room and rules" aria-label="Room and rules">? <span class="lbl">Room</span></button></header><div class="notices"></div><section class="seats arc" aria-label="Players"><div class="seat     " data-seat="2" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Dev"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Dev</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="8 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>8</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="2" aria-label="Dev has bought no films this season" title="Dev has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal<span class="mark now">deciding</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">Sells next</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal has bought no films this season" title="Bilal has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat     " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra bought 1 film: 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div></section><section class="stage  stage-offer"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Wedding Mein Wrong Number — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Double Feature"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e0d1bb8d</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>×2</b><span>Double Feature</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Wedding Mein Wrong Number</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Every uncle thinks he is the hero.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></div><div class="slot-empty">+ ?</div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction."><span class="type-icon">×2</span> Double Feature<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Double Feature: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">Who adds a second Pappu Pandey film?</div><div class="seller">🔨 Dev played it alone<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Bilal</b></span><span class="hint"> · Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-offer" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop now "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state">+ ?</span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: line