nt"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true">₹</span><input inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-label="Bid amount" type="text" value="1"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"> cr</span><span class="of">of ₹140 cr</span></label><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One more">+</button></div><div class="quick"><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+5</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+10</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn" disabled="">min</button></div><div class="act-row"><button class="btn primary big">Bid ₹1 cr <kbd>Enter</kbd></button><button type="button" class="btn big ">Pass <kbd>Esc</kbd></button></div></form></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra (seller)</option><option value="1">You</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="0"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me owing   " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap=