ms this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="cell-tag">₹20 cr</span><span class="cell-held">hand 2</span></span><span class="star-cell  flat " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="cell-who"><svg class="star-face" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg><b>TT</b></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="cell-tag">–</span><span class="cell-held">hand 2</span></span><span class="star-cell   " style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="cell-who"><svg class="star-face" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg><b>RR</b></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="cell-tag">₹10 cr</span><span class="cell-held">hand 2</span></span><span class="strip-more" aria-hidden="true"><i class="i-dot">i</i></span></button></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-free"><b>Dev</b> takes <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Wedding Mein Wrong Number</span></span> for free</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Chitra</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #a35cc2;">Senapati On Leave</span></span> from <b class="you">you</b> for ₹17 cr</li><li class="log-round">Sankranti begins. Everyone is dealt 9 films. <b class="you">You</b> go first.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

exports[`room pages > open-selling 1`] = `"<div class="table acting "><header class="topbar"><span class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></span><button type="button" class="round round-btn" title="All seasons: the deal, the scoring and where the game is" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg class="round-ring" viewBox="0 0 22 22" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true">#2cbf88b0</svg><b>Sankranti</b> · season 1 of 4</button><span class="grow"></span><button class="icon-btn" title="Freeze the game: the clock, the bots and all moves wait" aria-label="Freeze the game"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M12 3v18M4.2 7.5l15.6 9M4.2 16.5l15.6-9"></path><path d="M9.5 4.5L12 7l2.5-2.5M9.5 19.5L12 17l2.5 2.5"></path></svg> <span class="lbl">Freeze</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Auction log" aria-label="Auction log">☰ <span class="lbl">Log</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Sound on" aria-label="Turn sound off">🔊</button><button class="icon-btn" aria-expanded="false" title="Room and rules" aria-label="Room and rules">? <span class="lbl">Room</span></button></header><div class="notices"></div><section class="seats arc" aria-label="Players"><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="2" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Dev"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Dev<span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="2" aria-label="Dev bought 3 films: 1 Bijli Bhullar, 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #d0583f; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">✸</span><span class="mc-short">BB</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal<span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal bought 2 films: 2 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n2" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span><b class="mc-count">2</b></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra<span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra bought 2 films: 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div></section><section class="stage owing stage-open"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #1f0d17; --h: #c9577f; --t: #f8d9e5;" title="Rishta Via Resume — Kajal Khurana (Rom-com) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#2c48d011</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">KK</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Kajal Khurana</div><div class="poster-title">Rishta Via Resume</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Bauji said no. The violins said yes.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#2f4c4f0f</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out."><span class="type-icon">⇈</span> Open Auction<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Open Auction: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">No bids yet</div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: Chitra<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>You</b></span><span class="hint"> · Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-open" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop waiting me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra 🔨</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar your-turn"><form class="bidbox"><div class="bid-amount"><button type="button" class="step" disabled="" aria-label="One less">−</button><label class="amount"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true">₹</span><input inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-label="Bid amount" type="text" value="1"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"> cr</span><span class="of">of ₹118 cr</span></label><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One more">+</button></div><div class="quick"><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+5</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+10</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn" disabled="">min</button></div><div class="act-row"><button class="btn primary big">Bid ₹1 cr <kbd>Enter</kbd></button><button type="button" class="btn big timed">No bid <kbd>Esc</kbd><span class="bid-clock  " title="When this runs out, everyone still in is done"><span class="secs">12s</span><span class="drain" aria-hidden="true"><span style="animation-duration: 30000ms; animation-delay: -18000ms; animation-play-state: running;"></span></span></span></button></div></form></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra (seller)</option><option value="1">You</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="0"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me owing   " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin: can call results agreed on voice">★</span><span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">You sell next</div><div class="owned" data-owned="1" aria-label="You have bought no films this season" title="You have bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><h2>Your hand <small>7</small></h2><button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="What the auction icons mean"><i class="i-dot">i</i> <span>Icons</span></button><span class="grow"></span><span class="money" title="Your money (only you can see it)">₹118 cr</span></div><div class="hand"><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="group-label">✸ BB <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Kaanoon Ka Thappad, Bijli Bhullar, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1e0f0c; --h: #d0583f; --t: #f7dccf;" title="Kaanoon Ka Thappad — Bijli Bhullar (Action) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#85c61fd8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">BB</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Bijli Bhullar</div><div class="poster-title">Kaanoon Ka Thappad</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Rated A for Acceleration.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#92dc58e6</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="group-label">♥ KK <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Chiffon Mein Chills, Kajal Khurana, Sealed Bid (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1f0d17; --h: #c9577f; --t: #f8d9e5;" title="Chiffon Mein Chills — Kajal Khurana (Rom-com) — Sealed Bid"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e6a9e1e8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>✉</b><span>Sealed Bid</span></div><di