s="who"><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="Flop: Kajal Khurana is outside the top three this season, so films bought now would pay nothing">flop</span></li><li class="star-row    " style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="2 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="What one Pappu Pandey film would pay if the season ended now: ₹20 cr as Superhit, plus its scores from earlier seasons">₹20 cr<small>Superhit</small></span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural<em class="held"> · 2 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Tantrik Tiwari films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row hot   " style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic<em class="held"> · 2 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="4 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="What one Rajkumari Ratnavali film would pay if the season ended now: ₹30 cr as All-Time Blockbuster, plus its scores from earlier seasons">₹30 cr<small>All-Time Blockbuster</small></span><span class="warn">1 more ends the season</span></li></ol></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-free"><b>Bilal</b> takes <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #a35cc2;">Rajtilak Rescheduled</span></span> for free</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Bilal</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #a35cc2;">Durbar Mein Dhol</span></span> from <b>Dev</b> for ₹10 cr</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Chitra</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana</span></span> from <b class="you">you</b> for ₹1 cr</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Dev</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #a35cc2;">Ghoda Express</span></span> from <b>Chitra</b> for ₹24 cr</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

