aria-label="Dev bought 3 films: 1 Bijli Bhullar, 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #d0583f; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">✸</span><span class="mc-short">BB</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal<span class="mark now">sealing</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">Sells next</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal bought 2 films: 2 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n2" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span><b class="mc-count">2</b></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra<span class="mark now">sealing</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra bought 3 films: 1 Kajal Khurana, 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #c9577f; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♥</span><span class="mc-short">KK</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div></section><section class="stage owing stage-sealed"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Mirror Mat Dekhna — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Sealed Bid"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#c8a9eb31</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>✉</b><span>Sealed Bid</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Mirror Mat Dekhna</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The background score is the real ghost.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="Everyone bids in secret, once. Highest wins; a tie goes to the seller, then clockwise."><span class="type-icon">✉</span> Sealed Bid<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Sealed Bid: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">0 of 4 bids sealed</div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: Dev<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Bilal</